{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ded166a3-02bc-455c-b60f-054b8aecba71",
    "name": "CompuNet3 - NestJS + PostgreSQL",
    "description": "Colección para probar la API del curso Computación en Internet 3 (NestJS + TypeORM + PostgreSQL). Usa la variable de colección {{baseUrl}} (por defecto http://localhost:9000/api) para no repetir la URL en cada request.\n\nAntes de usarla: levantar la app con `npm run start:dev` y tener PostgreSQL corriendo con las credenciales definidas en el `.env` del proyecto.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:9000/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "studentTerm",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "id (UUID), name o nickname de un estudiante existente, para usar en 'Buscar estudiante'"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "ee450cfd-1373-432c-909a-094b8c048b25",
      "name": "Student",
      "description": "Endpoints del módulo student",
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "b218fbf2-5da4-4609-ab89-25b117ede08c",
          "name": "Crear estudiante",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Ana Pérez\",\n  \"age\": 21,\n  \"email\": \"ana@example.com\",\n  \"isActive\": true,\n  \"gender\": \"Female\",\n  \"favoriteSubjects\": [\"Math\", \"History\"],\n  \"grades\": [\n    { \"subject\": \"Math\", \"grade\": 90 },\n    { \"subject\": \"History\", \"grade\": 85 }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/student",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["student"]
            },
            "description": "Crea un estudiante. `gender` debe ser 'Male', 'Female' u 'Other' (@IsIn en CreateStudent). `favoriteSubjects` y `grades` son opcionales; si se envían `grades`, se guardan junto con el estudiante gracias al `cascade: true` de la relación Student -> Grades."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "id": "4b38378b-855e-45a2-909f-d272561b9785",
          "name": "Listar estudiantes (paginado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/student?limit=10&skip=0",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["student"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "10",
                  "description": "Cantidad máxima de estudiantes a devolver (opcional)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "skip",
                  "value": "0",
                  "description": "Cantidad de estudiantes a saltar, para paginar (opcional)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista estudiantes con paginación. `limit` y `skip` son opcionales (PaginationDto)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "id": "5a8043a4-5902-4ab3-8da5-02e5d082bede",
          "name": "Buscar estudiante (id, name o nickname)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/student/:term",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["student", ":term"],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "term",
                  "value": "{{studentTerm}}",
                  "description": "UUID del estudiante, o su name/nickname (ver findOne en student.service.ts)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Busca un estudiante por id (si `term` es un UUID válido) o por name/nickname/email (comparación case-insensitive). Incluye sus grades en la respuesta."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "id": "7c1f9a62-4d3e-4b1a-9f21-0e5b8c7d6a01",
          "name": "Actualizar estudiante (PATCH)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"age\": 22,\n  \"grades\": [\n    { \"subject\": \"Math\", \"grade\": 95 },\n    { \"subject\": \"History\", \"grade\": 85 },\n    { \"subject\": \"Physics\", \"grade\": 80 }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/student/:term",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["student", ":term"],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "term",
                  "value": "{{studentTerm}}",
                  "description": "UUID (o name/nickname/email) del estudiante a actualizar"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Actualiza los campos enviados (UpdateStudentDto: todos opcionales). Si el body incluye `grades`, se **reemplazan** todas las notas del estudiante por las nuevas. Requiere `Content-Type: application/json`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "id": "8d2e0b73-5e4f-4c2b-0a32-1f6c9d8e7b02",
          "name": "Eliminar estudiante (DELETE)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/student/:term",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["student", ":term"],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "term",
                  "value": "{{studentTerm}}",
                  "description": "UUID (o name/nickname/email) del estudiante a eliminar"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Elimina el estudiante y, por el `onDelete: \"CASCADE\"` de la relación, también sus notas. Devuelve `{ id, deleted: true }`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "9e3f1c84-6f5a-4d3c-1b43-2a7d0e9f8c03",
      "name": "User",
      "description": "Endpoints del módulo user (registro e inicio de sesión)",
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "a04f2d95-7a6b-4e4d-2c54-3b8e1f0a9d04",
          "name": "Registrarse (signup)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ana@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secreto123\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Ana Pérez\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/signup",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user", "signup"]
            },
            "description": "Crea un usuario. La contraseña se guarda hasheada con bcrypt. `password` debe tener entre 8 y 16 caracteres. La respuesta nunca incluye la contraseña."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "id": "b15a3ea6-8b7c-4f5e-3d65-4c9f2a1b0e05",
          "name": "Iniciar sesión (auth)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ana@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secreto123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/auth",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user", "auth"]
            },
            "description": "Valida las credenciales con bcrypt y devuelve el usuario (sin contraseña). Email inexistente → 404; contraseña incorrecta → 401."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c26b4fb7-9c8d-4a6f-4e76-5d0a3b2c1f06",
      "name": "Seed",
      "description": "Endpoints del módulo seed (datos de prueba)",
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "d37c5a08-0a9e-4b7a-5f87-6e1b4c3d2a07",
          "name": "Cargar datos de prueba (seed)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/seed",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["seed"]
            },
            "description": "Borra todos los estudiantes existentes y carga los de prueba (40 estudiantes con 81 notas). Devuelve `{ \"message\": \"SEED EXECUTED\" }`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
